      "sourceStart": 262,
      "sourceEnd": 385,
      "original": "### 1.1. A number $\\lambda\\in F$ is called a **zero** or **root** of a polynomial $p \\in \\mathcal{P}(F)$ if $p(\\lambda)=0$.",
